🪑 MAROOM

AI-powered furniture recommendation app with an intuitive swipe interface and 2D floor planning

MAROOM is a mobile application that revolutionizes furniture shopping by combining Tinder-style swipe mechanics with intelligent AI recommendations and interactive floor planning features.
📱 Features
Core Features

Swipe-Based Discovery: Browse furniture with intuitive left/right swipe gestures
AI-Powered Recommendations: Personalized furniture suggestions based on your preferences
2D Floor Planning: Visualize furniture arrangements in your space
Detailed Product Views: Tap-to-flip animation revealing comprehensive furniture information

Planned Features (Phase 2)

Additional gesture controls (swipe up for extended features)
Enhanced user interactions
Advanced filtering options

